  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e25f91d4f4ce41c4bcbcb99d71c1eaa6, type: 3}
  m_Name: Introduction
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Introduction
  pages:
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1c4777d8270d4bc8b1a2c71d94f11a01, type: 3}
    description: Han was born in a family of superheroes. Everyone in his family had a special gift.
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1c4777d8270d4bc8b1a2c71d94f11a01, type: 3}
    description: When Han turned 10 years old, he awaked the ability to phase through certain walls depending on his focus.
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1c4777d8270d4bc8b1a2c71d94f11a01, type: 3}
    description: As he was showing his super powers to his friends, some scientists took notice.
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1c4777d8270d4bc8b1a2c71d94f11a01, type: 3}
    description: The scientists decided to kidnap him to experiment on him and try to replicate his powers for themselves like they did to many other poor souls.
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1c4777d8270d4bc8b1a2c71d94f11a01, type: 3}
    description: They locked him in an electrically charged cell which shocked him whenever he tried to phase through it.
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1c4777d8270d4bc8b1a2c71d94f11a01, type: 3}
    description: However, the scientists didn't realize that Han slowly built a resistance against electricity a year of captivity.
